sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as ReportList<br/>«view»
    participant RC as ReportController<br/>«controller»
    participant RS as ReportService<br/>«service»
    participant RR as ReportRepository<br/>«repository»

    U->>FE: open /reports (optional status filter)
    FE->>RC: GET /api/reports?status&page&size
    RC->>RS: listReports(filters, pageable)
    RS->>RR: findByCompanyIdWithFilters(companyId, status, dateFrom, dateTo, pageable)
    RR-->>RS: page of ReportListItem
    RS-->>RC: page of ReportResponse
    RC-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>U: render paginated table
